---
/**
 * Marks a draft entry in `astro dev` (src/lib/showcase.ts). Builds never show
 * drafts, so this badge never reaches a deployed page. The e2e suite checks
 * that no `[data-draft]` element appears in a build.
 */
---

<span
  data-draft
  class="self-start rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-brand-dark bg-white px-3 py-[3px] font-black text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-dark"
>
  Draft · not live
</span>
